theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 30
text = "I’m the absence, yet I’m full,
A cloak at night, a shadow’s pull.
I drink the light and never shine,
In fear and form, I draw the line.
What color am I, so dark and deep,
Where secrets hide and silence sleeps?"

